# Gemini API key for AI object ID + pricing
# Get a key: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Option A — file local (đã gitignore), rồi chạy:
#   fvm flutter run --dart-define-from-file=.dart_defines.json
#
# Option B — dart-define trực tiếp:
#   fvm flutter run --dart-define=GEMINI_API_KEY=your_key_here
#
# Option C — paste key in-app (icon khóa trên màn quét).
#
# Copy: cp .dart_defines.json.example .dart_defines.json
GEMINI_API_KEY=
